      "value": "@{5a60e3832478a072c83fa7ce|full_name}: Yes, I’ve tried HLS streaming and already provided as service TopazChat 1.0 legacy version on AWS. But it has 5 seconds latency on VRChat. I’ve fine tuned segment duration to almost 1 second latency on the Chrome browser, but it has longer latency on VRC_SyncVideoStream.\nHow about latency on your try with VLC?",
